---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const now=[["Featured listing","30 days in a labeled \"Featured\" slot on the home page, your category and one /best/ guide. Verified badge once we check the tool works. Mention in the newsletter when it starts. Rankings unchanged.","$49 one-time ($29 intro for the first 5 vendors)"],["Developer-experience teardown","A written review of your docs, quickstart, pricing page and free tier, compared with 3 similar tools from our data, ending with 10 concrete fixes ranked by effort. Markdown/PDF within 5 days, private unless you want it published.","$149 one-time"]];
const later=[["Featured category slot","Top of one category page, labeled Sponsored","$300 / month"],["Homepage hero slot","1 rotating slot (max 2 sponsors), all pages banner","$750 / month"],["Newsletter primary slot","Top placement, 60-word blurb + link","$250 / issue"],["Newsletter classified","3-line text ad","$75 / issue"],["Verified profile","Badge, extended profile, comparison table, changelog","$99 / month"],["Launch bundle","Homepage 2 weeks + 2 newsletter primaries + 1 comparison writeup","$1,200 one-off"]];
---
<Base title="Sponsor — BuilderStack" description="Get a labeled Featured listing ($49) or a developer-experience teardown ($149) on BuilderStack, a vendor-neutral directory of crypto developer tools. Rankings are never for sale."><h1>Sponsor BuilderStack</h1><p>Two one-time offers for crypto tool vendors. Paid in USDC; payment details are sent when you reply.</p>
<h2>Available now</h2>
<table>{now.map(o=><tr><td><b>{o[0]}</b></td><td>{o[1]}</td><td>{o[2]}</td></tr>)}</table>
<p>See a <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}teardowns/ponder/`}>sample teardown of Ponder</a> (unpaid, written to show the format).</p>
<h2>After launch</h2>
<p>Recurring placements open once the newsletter and traffic numbers are live.</p>
<table>{later.map(o=><tr><td><b>{o[0]}</b></td><td>{o[1]}</td><td>{o[2]}</td></tr>)}</table>
<p>No token/presale/casino ads, no unaudited yield, pump groups or memecoins. Every paid placement is labeled. Rankings are never for sale. Contact: sponsor@ (placeholder).</p></Base>
